---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Blog"
description: "Notes on building GuerillaType — features shipping, decisions made, lessons learned. RSS available."
permalink: /blog/
---

<div class="blog-index">
  <header class="blog-index__head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Notes from the keyboard</p>
    <h1>Blog</h1>
    <p class="article-lede">Posts on building GuerillaType -- new features, design decisions, the occasional rabbit hole. Subscribe via <a href="/feed.xml">RSS</a>, or scan by tag.</p>
    <p class="blog-index__tags">
      <strong>Tags:</strong>
      {% set allTags = [] %}
      {%- for p in collections.post -%}
        {%- for t in p.data.tags -%}
          {%- if t != "post" and allTags.indexOf(t) === -1 -%}
            {%- set allTags = (allTags.push(t), allTags) -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {% for t in allTags %}
      <a class="blog-tag-chip" href="/blog/tag/{{ t | slugify }}/">{{ t }}</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </p>
  </header>

  {% if collections.post and collections.post.length %}
  <div class="blog-list">
    {% for post in collections.post | reverse %}
    <article class="blog-card">
      {% if post.data.tags %}
      <p class="blog-card__date">
        {%- for t in post.data.tags -%}{%- if t != "post" -%}<a class="blog-card__tag" href="/blog/tag/{{ t | slugify }}/">{{ t }}</a>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
      </p>
      {% endif %}
      <h2 class="blog-card__title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p class="blog-card__deck">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      <p class="blog-card__readmore"><a href="{{ post.url }}">Read post →</a></p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="muted">No posts yet -- come back soon.</p>
  {% endif %}

  <aside class="blog-index__rss">
    <p>Subscribe via RSS: <a href="/feed.xml"><code>/feed.xml</code></a></p>
  </aside>
</div>
